.* PTF: the task menu for fixes.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='PTF'.
:IMPORT NAME=APYPTF PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=CPYPTF PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPPTF PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPPTFCVR PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=INSPTF PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=LODPTF PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=RMVPTF PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SNDPTFORD PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKPTFGRP PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=PTF HELP=HLPPTF KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Program Temporary Fix
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI HELP=LODPTF OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?LODPTF'.Load a program temporary fix
:MENUI HELP=APYPTF OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?APYPTF'.Apply a program temporary fix
:MENUI HELP=CPYPTF OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?CPYPTF'.Copy a program temporary fix
:MENUI HELP=RMVPTF OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?RMVPTF'.Remove a program temporary fix
:MENUI HELP=DSPPTF OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?DSPPTF'.Display a program temporary fix
:MENUI HELP=SNDPTFORD OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?SNDPTFORD'.Order a program temporary fix
:MENUI HELP=INSPTF OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?INSPTF'.Install a program temporary fix from a list
:MENUI HELP=INSPTF OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?INSPTF LICPGM(*ALL)'.Install program temporary fix package
:MENUI HELP='PTF/OPT9' OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD ?CPYPTFCVR'.Copy PTF Cover Letter
:MENUI HELP=DSPPTFCVR OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?DSPPTFCVR'.Display PTF Cover Letter
:MENUI HELP='PTF/OPT11' OPTION=11 ACTION='CMD ?DLTPTF'.Delete a program temporary fix
:MENUI HELP=WRKPTFGRP OPTION=12 ACTION='CMD WRKPTFGRP'.Work with PTF groups
:MENUI HELP='PTF/OPT13' OPTION=13 ACTION='CMD ?CPYPTFGRP'.Copy PTF group
:MENUI HELP='PTF/OPT70' OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDPTF'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPPTF.Program Temporary Fix - Help
:P.Fixes to the system's code: load them, apply them, take them back off
and see which are in place.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PTF/OPT9'.Copy PTF Cover Letter
:P.Option 9. Runs the CPYPTFCVR command&colon. Copy PTF Cover Letter.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PTF/OPT11'.Delete a program temporary fix
:P.Option 11. Runs the DLTPTF command&colon. Delete a program temporary
fix.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PTF/OPT13'.Copy PTF group
:P.Option 13. Runs the CPYPTFGRP command&colon. Copy PTF group.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PTF/OPT70'.Related commands
:P.Option 70. Shows menu CMDPTF&colon. Related commands.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
